<title>JAPAN: Gajoen shares to be delisted on May 5--TSE.</title>
<headline>Gajoen shares to be delisted on May 5--TSE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Gajoen Kanko KK will be delisted from the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) on May 5, the exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
